## Scope

The MIT grant above covers this plugin's source code: the QML files, the
JavaScript calendar model, and the tests.

It does not cover the bundled artwork or the bundled typeface. The seal glyphs
under `seals/` are licensed CC BY-SA 4.0 and the font under `fonts/` is licensed
OFL-1.1. Each keeps its own terms, so redistributing this plugin means honouring
all three. See CREDITS.md for the file-by-file provenance and licences.
